main = snd (draw h = Uniform in (exp h, True))
-- Found while minimizing item 8 of docs task fuzz-admission-oracle-bugs: a
-- silent wrong result. `snd`'s inverse leaves ANY in the slot holding
-- `exp h`, and `exp`'s applicability guard read it: the interpreter raised a
-- type error, and the optimizer folded the guard into "impossible", p = 0.
-- The unevaluable witness of a single-use binding is now answered by
-- compiling the body with the binding unrecovered. `snd (exp h, True)` is True
-- on every draw.
